{
  "$comment": [
    "Chiang Mai 2024 partners, read off the live Webflow recap page on",
    "2026-08-23: invisible.garden/chiang-mai-recap, sections 'Shout out to",
    "Sponsors' and 'Shout out to Community Partners'. Both were published there",
    "as one composite image each, with no names in the markup and empty alt",
    "text, so the names below were read from the artwork.",
    "",
    "Sponsor logos were cut out of the composite and uploaded to",
    "partners/<slug>.webp. They are white-on-transparent, the artwork the",
    "sponsors themselves supplied, so they need a dark surface.",
    "",
    "Community partners carry no logo: their artwork is a tiled mosaic that",
    "cannot be cut apart cleanly. The band renders their name instead, which is",
    "how the old homepage listed partners anyway.",
    "",
    "Spelling follows the old homepage's own text list where a name appears in",
    "both. ETH Vietnam, Devfolio and ZuGarden are in the recap artwork but not",
    "in that list.",
    "",
    "Not here, because no source says which edition they belong to: Arbitrum",
    "DAO, Ethereum Everywhere and GCC, the three in the old homepage sponsor",
    "band, and the 19 names in the homepage partner run that the Chiang Mai",
    "artwork does not show. Most of those are Latin American and probably",
    "Buenos Aires 2025, but probably is not good enough to publish.",
    "",
    "Load with: pnpm tsx scripts/db/seed-partners.ts content/partners.chiang-mai-2024.json",
    "",
    "Community logos were cut out of the Webflow mosaic webflow-assets/Group-81.png on 2026-08-23: 16 tiles, found by the transparent gaps between them. OpenBuild uses the white wordmark this repo already ships instead of its tile."
